1
00:00:00,577 --> 00:00:02,997
(Penny:)All right.
Leonard fairly calls the question:

2
00:00:03,163 --> 00:00:05,333
Who is in favor
of abandoning our game...

3
00:00:05,498 --> 00:00:08,338
(Sheldon:)...and confronting
Penny's steroid-infused ex-boyfriend...

4
00:00:08,501 --> 00:00:11,921
(Sheldon:)...in a suicidal mission
to extract money from him?

5
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:16,510
(Sheldon:)Say hi to Kurt for us.

6
00:00:17,844 --> 00:00:18,924
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

7
00:00:19,095 --> 00:00:21,805
(Leonard:)When Frodo left the Shire
to take the one ring to Mordor...

8
00:00:21,973 --> 00:00:23,933
...didn't Samwise, Pippin and Merry go?

9
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,310
- They did.
- Well?

10
00:00:25,477 --> 00:00:27,937
(Sheldon:)They had a terrible time of it, Leonard.

11
00:00:29,606 --> 00:00:32,026
(Raj:)Plus, no one stole their pants.

12
00:00:33,068 --> 00:00:34,148
(Penny:)Fine.

13
00:00:34,319 --> 00:00:37,699
(Leonard:)Enjoy your little game.
I'll make this quest on my own.

14
00:00:37,864 --> 00:00:39,034
(Howard:)Leonard, wait.

15
00:00:39,199 --> 00:00:41,989
Take a jacket, it's shpritzing a little.

16
00:00:42,953 --> 00:00:44,953
(Leonard:)You guys suck.

17
00:00:47,874 --> 00:00:50,044
Come on, please. He's so big.

18
00:00:52,879 --> 00:00:56,679
- Okay, is everyone clear on the plan?
- Yes. Koothrappali's going to wet himself...

19
00:00:56,841 --> 00:01:02,021
(Howard:)...I'm gonna throw up, Sheldon's
gonna run away, and you're going to die.

